%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ad6b4272890c70c4eb3d3dfe4810ac24, type: 3}
  m_Name: D_Ovan_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Morsoul.Dialogue::Morsoul.Dialogue.DialogueData
  id: D_Ovan_01
  nodes:
  - id: ovan_greeting
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: Step aside, Ovan. The Investigator's Guild is taking jurisdiction over the vault incident.
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_challenge
  - id: ovan_challenge
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "(Wiping sweat from his brow with an embroidered handkerchief) \"Astra? The Council sent their surveyor? And what in Saint Althea\u2019s name is that... that walking boulder behind you?\""
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: golem_scan
  - id: golem_scan
    speakerName: Golem
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '[OPTICAL SCAN: Subject heart rate elevated. Cortisol perspiration detected. Unit status: Non-hostile.] "I am an analytical construct licensed under Guild charter. State the parameters of the vault breach, Guildmaster."'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_briefing
  - id: ovan_briefing
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "It\u2019s financial ruin, that's what it is! Master Ignatius\u2019 subterranean storage vault\u2014the one holding the seasonal reserve of Greater Restoration Draughts\u2014was breached three hours before dawn. Ten thousand gold ducats worth of inventory, dissolved into thin air! Ignatius claims dark cultists used forbidden volatile magic!"
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_options
  - id: ovan_options
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: What else does the Investigator's Guild require of me?
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options:
    - label: Inquire about the vault's security
      nextNodeId: ovan_security
      requiresFlag: 
    - label: Ask about Master Ignatius
      nextNodeId: ovan_ignatius
      requiresFlag: 
    - label: Demand crime scene access
      nextNodeId: ovan_warrant
      requiresFlag: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - id: ovan_security
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "It\u2019s a masterwork Dwarven cylinder! Four tumblers, reinforced cold-iron plating, fitted into bedrock. You couldn't crack it with a siege ram. There are only two keys in existence: Master Ignatius carries one on his personal brass chain, and the second is sealed in my office archives under wax. The archives were never touched!"
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: golem_conclusion
  - id: golem_conclusion
    speakerName: Golem
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: 'Conclusion: The perimeter requires an authentic physical key for non-destructive ingress.'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_registry
  - id: eliza_registry
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "(Smirks) \"Locked from the outside without a scratch on the door... Sounds cozy. We\u2019ll take the key registry record for our file.\""
    registersClue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0bad7376d47ec54d996f4a33840af2c, type: 2}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_options
  - id: ovan_ignatius
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "He\u2019s in his parlor inside, practically having apoplexy! Demanding emergency compensation from the City Commercial Treasury before the noon bell! If the Council doesn't reimburse him, he threatens to pull all pharmaceutical trade from Asterveil."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: eliza_hurry
  - id: eliza_hurry
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "He\u2019s quick to demand municipal gold for a crime that barely cooled down. {PlayerName}, we need to inspect that crime scene before his alchemists 'clean up' the evidence."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: ovan_options
  - id: ovan_warrant
    speakerName: Guildmaster Ovan
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: '(Sighs, stamping a parchment seal) "Take it. The lower cellar grate is unlocked. But be warned: the vault still reeks of that purple sorcery. Don''t touch anything you can''t pay for!"'
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: C1_WarrantGranted
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: warrant_close
  - id: warrant_close
    speakerName: Eliza
    speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Warrant in hand. Come on, {PlayerName} \u2014 let's see what that vault is really hiding."
    registersClue: {fileID: 0}
    setsFlag: 
    requiresFlag: 
    options: []
    nextNodeId: 
  startNodeId: ovan_greeting
  portraits: []
